<title>HONG KONG: Nomura sets warrants on China Travel.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets warrants on China Travel.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International (Hong Kong) said on Tuesday it issued 695 million 10-percent in-the-money call warrants on China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.582     PREMIUM	 18 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.111440  GEARING	 3.57X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  19.JAN.98    LAUNCH DATE   17.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$3.98</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF SHARES AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S DISCRETION.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
